、问题复盘、持续改善落地，推动行政工作标准化、规范化、精细化、高效化；\n10.配合业务轮岗，执行上级临时安排的工作。","Require":"教育程度:大学本科\n工作经历:\n1. 具备1-2个行政模块管理经验\n2. 具备2-3年以上大型企业行政相关工作经验\n3. 有行政汇报、会议纪要、项目总结、高层汇报等PPT专项输出经验，能熟练运用PPT完成各类汇报材料制作，能独立设计逻辑清晰、视觉呈现专业的演示文稿（附作品集优先）\n4. 精通办公软件中各类常用函数及数据处理与分析，能熟练运用函数完成行政各项业务数据分析、报表自动化制作（附作品集优先）\n5. 擅长摄影、熟练应用图片及视频编辑软件、有微信公众号运营经验者优先（附作品集优先）\n所需专业:工商管理类,公共管理类,行政管理类\n其他要求:\n1. 规矩意识强、责任心强、执行力强，有较强的沟通协调能力和主动学习能力\n2. 工作积极主动、开朗大方、客户服务意识强，有良好的亲和力及抗压能力\n3. 善于观察与思考，有较强的分析及解决问题的能力\n4. 勇于创新、敢于打破常规，不断在探索和突破中成长\n语言要求:英语托业500以上或专业外语八级证书者优先","ClassificationOne":"行政类","ClassificationTwo":"武汉","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科及以上","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-26T17:25:14","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"ef8ff3f7-d74c-4538-8f84-e6aca51c2952","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":880103559,"PostDateInt":1793000213000,"PostDate":"2026-10-2